#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Transform calibrated phase currents into alpha/beta."
msgstr "将标定后的相电流变换到 alpha／beta 坐标。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Uses alpha=(2A-B-C)/3 and beta=(B-C)/sqrt(3)."
msgstr "使用 alpha=(2A-B-C)/3 和 beta=(B-C)/sqrt(3)。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Three finite A/B/C values, distinct from out."
msgstr "[in] 三个有限的 A／B／C 数值，与 out 分离。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[out] Separate result; unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立结果，失败时不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED; bounded pure Task/IRQ math."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 EXHAUSTED；有界的纯 Task／IRQ 数学计算。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Rotate stationary values into the electrical dq frame."
msgstr "将静止坐标值旋转到电气 dq 坐标。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Finite alpha/beta in one common unit."
msgstr "[in] 使用同一单位的有限 alpha／beta 数值。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Finite electrical angle in radians."
msgstr "[in] 有限电角度，单位 rad。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[out] Exclusive result; unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独占结果，失败时不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED; pure Task/IRQ math."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 EXHAUSTED；纯 Task／IRQ 数学计算。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Rotate dq values back to the stationary frame."
msgstr "将 dq 数值旋转回静止坐标。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Finite d/q in one common unit."
msgstr "[in] 使用同一单位的有限 d／q 数值。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Validate and copy a profile into unused zeroed storage."
msgstr "校验配置并复制到未使用且已清零的存储。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Pure initialization; no hardware effects or default profile."
msgstr "仅初始化软件，不影响硬件，也不选择默认配置。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[out] Fresh state, distinct from config; no live users."
msgstr "[out] 新状态，与 config 分离，且没有活跃使用者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Explicit finite profile, copied, never retained."
msgstr "[in] 显式且数值有限的配置；复制内容，不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; rejection preserves motor."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时保留 motor。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Calculate one complete sensored current-control plan."
msgstr "计算一个完整的有感电流控制计划。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Known storage aliases reject before mutation. Caller proves memory and "
"serial access. Bounded Task/IRQ math, including sinf/cosf/hypotf; no "
"physical WCET promise. Rejects missed sequence, timing, invalid measurement "
"and overcurrent."
msgstr ""
"已知存储别名在任何修改前拒绝。调用者证明内存有效并保证串行访问。有界 Task／IRQ 数学计算包含 "
"sinf／cosf／hypotf，不承诺实际最坏执行时间。拒绝漏序号、时序错误、无效测量和过流。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[inout] Initialized single-owner state and fixed profile."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、由单一所有者管理的状态与固定配置。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Complete input, stable for this call only."
msgstr "[in] 完整输入，仅在本次调用期间保持稳定。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Finite dq target, valid through planned apply."
msgstr "[in] 数值有限的 dq 目标，有效期覆盖计划采用时刻。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[out] Separate plan; unchanged on every failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立计划，任何失败时均不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS or exact latched error; FAULT blocks later steps."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确锁存的错误；FAULT 阻止后续 step。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Calculate a voltage decision without choosing switching or samples."
msgstr "计算电压决策，不选择开关或采样。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Bounded Task/IRQ math with the same ownership and timing contract as step. "
"The configured circular bound remains conservative; final switching/window "
"restrictions belong to the selected modulator. minimum_duty is ignored here;"
" the voltage bound is Vbus/sqrt(3)*maximum_modulation, avoiding a second "
"sampling reserve. Track final voltage once and close admission if hardware "
"commit fails."
msgstr ""
"与 step 保持相同所有权和时间合同的有界 Task/IRQ 数学。配置的圆形边界仍是保守边界，最终开关和窗口限制由所选调制器负责。此处忽略 "
"minimum_duty；电压边界为 Vbus/sqrt(3)*maximum_modulation，避免再次预留采样余量。最终电压只 tracking"
" 一次；硬件提交失败时关闭准入。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[inout] Initialized single-executor current controller."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且只有一个执行者的电流控制器。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Complete calibrated, qualified same-epoch observation."
msgstr "[in] 完整、已标定、已确认有效且处于同一 epoch 的观察。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Complete target valid through the planned output."
msgstr "[in] 在计划输出时刻仍有效的完整目标。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[out] Separate result, unchanged on rejection or failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立结果；拒绝或失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS or exact latched validation or numerical error."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或锁存的精确校验／数值错误。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Feed final quantization/actuator limitation back once."
msgstr "回馈一次最终量化／执行器限制。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Corrects by final-minus-previous-plan, avoiding duplicate back-calculation. "
"It is not a measured voltage receipt."
msgstr "使用最终计划减去前一计划的差值修正，避免重复回算。它不代表实测电压回执。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[inout] Same owner after the latest successful step."
msgstr "[inout] 最新一次成功 step 后的同一所有者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Exact latest cycle, not yet tracked."
msgstr "[in] 精确匹配且尚未跟踪的最新周期。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Final implemented plan in output dq V."
msgstr "[in] 最终实施的计划，使用输出 dq 坐标，单位 V。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS, STATE or INVALID; rejects stale/duplicate tracking."
msgstr "SUCCESS、STATE 或 INVALID；拒绝过期或重复跟踪。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Retain the first hardware/outer-owner error in the kernel."
msgstr "在控制核中保留首个硬件／外层所有者错误。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Use after output commit failure, then withdraw via its owner."
msgstr "输出提交失败后调用，再由其所有者撤回。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized state."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的串行状态。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Non-success error describing the actual failure."
msgstr "[in] 描述实际失败的非成功错误码。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; never starts or stops hardware."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；从不启动或停止硬件。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Reset only algorithm history after externally joined stop."
msgstr "外部完成停止及会合后，仅重置算法历史。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Caller must first stop/join the real provider and all users. This function "
"cannot prove shutdown from a C object."
msgstr "调用者必须先停止真实 provider，并会合它与全部使用者。此函数无法仅凭 C 对象证明硬件已关闭。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[inout] Initialized same-owner state with no hardware users."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、由同一所有者管理且无硬件使用者的状态。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS or STATE; no output enable or hardware recovery."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 STATE；不使能输出，也不恢复硬件。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Begin an independent fixed-count zero-current estimate."
msgstr "开始独立的固定样本数零电流估计。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[out] Unused caller state, no concurrent users."
msgstr "[out] 未使用的调用者状态，不得有并发使用者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Count in [1,65535]."
msgstr "[in] 样本数，范围 [1,65535]。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Finite nonnegative raw-code spread per phase."
msgstr "[in] 各相允许的非负有限原始码跨度。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; rejection preserves state."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；拒绝时保留状态。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Consume one complete raw scan without device access."
msgstr "消费一次完整原始扫描，不访问设备。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Nonfinite/excess-spread scans poison the candidate; callers cannot silently "
"skip noisy samples and claim it passed."
msgstr "非有限值或跨度超限的扫描会使候选无效；调用者不能静默跳过噪声样本后声称通过。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[inout] Initialized same-owner candidate."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、由同一所有者管理的候选。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Three finite raw values, distinct from candidate."
msgstr "[in] 三个有限原始值，与候选分离。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE or EXHAUSTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE 或 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Copy a completed candidate; never applies or persists it."
msgstr "复制已完成候选，从不自动应用或持久化。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[in] Complete valid same-owner candidate."
msgstr "[in] 完整有效且由同一所有者管理的候选。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "[out] Three distinct result values, unchanged on error."
msgstr "[out] 三个独立结果值，错误时不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE or INVALID; pure bounded calculation."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE 或 INVALID；纯有界计算。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Amplitude-invariant stationary frame, with phase A on alpha."
msgstr "幅值不变的静止坐标，A 相位于 alpha 轴。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Rotating-frame values; q is positive beta at electrical angle zero."
msgstr "旋转坐标值；电角度为零时，q 沿 beta 正方向。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Immutable explicit profile; gains use A, V and seconds."
msgstr "不可变的显式配置；增益使用 A、V 和秒。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Kp is V/A and Ki is V/(A*s). Limits are inclusive. Modulation is (0,1]; "
"minimum_duty is [0,0.5). The fixed-modulation step uses the bound "
"Vbus/sqrt(3)*maximum_modulation*(1-2*minimum_duty). This conservative bound "
"reserves a common low-side sampling window; it does not prove analog "
"settling or any Board route. Anti-windup is an inverse-second back-"
"calculation rate. Initial dt uses nominal_period_us; later dt uses "
"consecutive sample times. Domain/epoch must remain valid and nonzero. The "
"caller proves phase current calibration, direction and actual "
"sample/angle/apply timing. Mechanical angle is motor-shaft radians, already "
"direction-normalized; pole pairs are applied exactly once."
msgstr ""
"Kp 的单位为 V/A，Ki 为 V/(A*s)。限值包含边界。Modulation 为 (0,1]，minimum_duty 为 "
"[0,0.5)。固定调制 step 使用 Vbus/sqrt(3)*maximum_modulation*(1-2*minimum_duty) "
"边界。该保守边界预留共同低侧采样窗口，不证明模拟建立或任何 Board 路线。Anti-windup 是以秒的倒数（s⁻¹）为单位的反算率。初始 dt "
"使用 nominal_period_us，之后使用连续采样时间。Domain/epoch 必须保持有效且非零。调用者证明相电流标定、方向及实际 "
"sample/angle/apply 时间。机械角是已规范方向的电机轴弧度；极对数只应用一次。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "One complete calibrated sample and its planned output boundary."
msgstr "一次完整标定采样及其计划输出边界。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Times are microseconds in one declared domain/epoch. sample_time_us is the "
"declared measurement event, not an IRQ observation. A hardware bridge must "
"separately identify a scheduled proxy and bound its error. observed_at_us "
"states when these values became known to this executor; "
"sample<=observed<=apply and angle<=observed must hold. Angle may be acquired"
" after sampling, with bounded backward projection. Apply time is a plan, not"
" proof of physical output. A separately validated mechanical velocity "
"predicts angle for sampling and output. Sequence starts at any value, then "
"increases by exactly one without wrap. No pointer is retained. Phase A/B/C "
"currents use A, Vbus uses V, and motor shaft angle/velocity use rad/rad/s. A"
" common event or a bounded-skew approximation must be established outside "
"this numerical kernel."
msgstr ""
"所有时间使用同一声明时间域／epoch 的微秒单位。sample_time_us 是声明的测量事件，不是 IRQ "
"观察时间。硬件桥接必须单独标明计划时刻替代值并约束误差。observed_at_us 表示本执行者获知这些值的时刻；必须满足 "
"sample<=observed<=apply 及 "
"angle<=observed。角度可在采样后取得，但向过去时刻投影的跨度必须有界。采用时间是计划，不证明实际输出。分别验证的机械速度用于预测采样及输出时刻角度。序号可从任意值开始，之后每次恰好递增一且不得回绕。不保留指针。A／B／C"
" 相电流使用 A，Vbus 使用 V，电机轴角度／速度使用 rad／rad/s。共同事件或有界偏斜近似必须在本数值核之外成立。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Complete dq current target; equality with its expiry is expired."
msgstr "完整 dq 电流目标；达到有效期边界即过期。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Current-control voltage decision before any switching modulation."
msgstr "任何开关调制之前的电流环电压决策。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Values use the same frames and units as nx_motor_output_t. There are no duty"
" fields: a selected modulator must jointly plan switching, sampling and "
"quantization, then track its final voltage once. This decision never proves "
"that hardware staged or applied an output."
msgstr ""
"数值沿用 nx_motor_output_t 的坐标系和单位。没有 duty 字段：选定调制器必须共同规划开关、采样与量化，再对最终电压 "
"tracking 一次。该决策从不证明硬件已经 staged 或 applied 输出。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Full normalized A/B/C duty plan; not a hardware completion receipt."
msgstr "完整的归一化 A／B／C 占空比计划，不是硬件完成回执。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"requested_voltage and planned_voltage use V in the output-angle dq frame. "
"measured_current uses A in the sample-angle frame. The caller commits the "
"entire plan through the sole hardware owner; a commit error must latch the "
"motor fault and follow that owner's withdrawal. No actual phase voltage or "
"exact physical update is inferred here."
msgstr ""
"requested_voltage 和 planned_voltage 使用输出角度下的 dq 坐标，单位 V。measured_current "
"使用采样角度下的坐标，单位 "
"A。调用者通过唯一硬件所有者提交完整计划；提交错误必须锁存电机故障，并按该所有者合同撤回。这里不推断实际相电压或精确物理更新。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Independent serialized algorithm state; fields are not controls."
msgstr "独立的串行算法状态；字段不作为控制入口。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"No hardware/OS/heap/clock access. One executor owns all operations. Task and"
" IRQ must not concurrently access it. Failed steps preserve integrators and "
"output, and latch fault. Success advances algorithm history before hardware "
"commit; commit failure must close admission."
msgstr ""
"不访问硬件／OS／堆／时钟。全部操作由一个执行者拥有。任务与 IRQ "
"不得并发访问。失败时保留积分器和输出并锁存故障。成功会在硬件提交前推进算法历史；提交失败必须关闭准入。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid "Bounded raw offset estimator, independent from live motor parameters."
msgstr "有界原始偏置估计器，与活跃电机参数独立。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:69
msgid ""
"Only use samples acquired under externally proven zero-current conditions. "
"Neither zero mean nor low spread proves zero real current. It never "
"energizes hardware, changes calibration or writes storage."
msgstr "仅使用在外部已证明零电流条件下取得的样本。零均值和低跨度都不能证明真实电流为零。它从不使能硬件、不修改标定，也不写入存储。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:73
msgid "Axis commands and execution"
msgstr "轴命令与执行"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Explicit-reference rotary axis control and command admission."
msgstr "显式参考的旋转轴控制与命令准入。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Selected reference units; no protocol scaling is implied."
msgstr "选定参考的单位，不隐含协议缩放。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Algorithm admission, never hardware power or borrow state."
msgstr "算法准入，不代表硬件功率或借用状态。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Explicit terminal software action after observed zero-speed dwell."
msgstr "观察到零速停留满足要求后的显式软件终态动作。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Initialize independent state without touching hardware."
msgstr "初始化独立状态，不影响硬件。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Task context. Reinitialize only after every user joins."
msgstr "任务上下文。仅在全部使用者会合后重新初始化。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[out] Unused aligned storage, disjoint from both inputs."
msgstr "[out] 未使用的对齐存储，与两个输入均不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Nonzero identity and finite step/feedback budgets."
msgstr "[in] 非零身份及有限的 step／反馈预算。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Complete legal revision, copied on success."
msgstr "[in] 完整合法的参数版本，成功时复制。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; rejection preserves axis."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；拒绝时保留 axis。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Establish READY from a valid reference, without actuation."
msgstr "由有效参考建立 READY，不执行驱动动作。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Task context. READY does not imply a powered or homed axis."
msgstr "任务上下文。READY 不表示轴已上电或已回零。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[inout] Initialized DISABLED owner, without a latched fault."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 DISABLED 所有者，且没有锁存故障。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Complete current same-domain observation."
msgstr "[in] 同一时间域中的完整当前观察。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Finite microsecond control time, not before feedback."
msgstr "[in] 有限微秒控制时间，不早于反馈。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; rejection preserves axis."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；拒绝时保留 axis。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Admit a copied new command, without adopting it yet."
msgstr "接纳并复制新命令，尚不采用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"Task context. Repeats/old frames never refresh authority. A newer accepted "
"command replaces an unadopted candidate; acceptance does not promise that "
"candidate was adopted. Mode changes require READY. POSITION uses sqrt during"
" planning and rejects active-motion replanning."
msgstr ""
"任务上下文。重复／旧帧从不刷新授权。新的已接纳命令会替换尚未采用的候选；接纳不保证该候选最终被采用。模式切换要求 READY。POSITION "
"在规划时使用 sqrt，并拒绝运动中重规划。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[inout] READY/RUNNING owner without a pending parameter set."
msgstr "[inout] 无待应用参数集的 READY／RUNNING 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Fresh identity, sequence, units and finite bounds."
msgstr "[in] 新鲜身份、序号、单位及有限边界。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Finite same-domain time at or after last_step."
msgstr "[in] 有限的同时间域时刻，不早于 last_step。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE/TIMEOUT or BUSY; no I/O or borrowing."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID/STATE/TIMEOUT 或 BUSY；不执行 I/O，也不建立借用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Calculate one bounded f32 axis cycle and copied decision."
msgstr "执行一个有界 f32 轴周期并复制决策。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"Task context. Age >= valid_until starts controlled STOPPING with valid "
"feedback; it does not disable a power stage. HOLDING keeps zero-speed PI "
"active; it never proves mechanical support or position holding. Caller "
"separately stops/joins I/O and performs mechanical support handover."
msgstr ""
"任务上下文。当前时间达到或超过 valid_until 时，在反馈有效的前提下开始受控 STOPPING；它不关闭功率级。HOLDING 保持零速 PI"
" 运行，从不证明机械支撑或位置保持。调用者单独停止／会合 I/O，并完成机械支撑交接。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[inout] READY/RUNNING/STOPPING/HOLDING owner."
msgstr "[inout] READY／RUNNING／STOPPING／HOLDING 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Fresh consecutive mechanical observation."
msgstr "[in] 新鲜、序号连续的机械观察。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Current-reference range supported downstream now."
msgstr "[in] 当前下游支持的电流参考范围。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Strictly increasing finite control time."
msgstr "[in] 严格递增的有限控制时间。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Seconds matching now-last_step within 1 us."
msgstr "[in] 与 now-last_step 对应的秒数，误差不超过 1 us。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[out] Separate aligned decision, unchanged on errors."
msgstr "[out] 独立对齐的决策，错误时不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or exact validation/numeric fault; errors latch FAULT without "
"pretending hardware has stopped."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确的校验／数值故障；错误会锁存 FAULT，不会假称硬件已停止。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Close new command admission and request controlled stopping."
msgstr "关闭新命令准入并请求受控停止。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"Task context. Continue step with valid feedback and power. Zero current is "
"not assumed to provide mechanical braking."
msgstr "任务上下文。继续在反馈与供电有效时执行 step。不假定零电流能够提供机械制动。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[inout] Initialized same-executor enabled owner."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、由同一执行者管理的已使能所有者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; no hardware access."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；不访问硬件。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Disable algorithm admission while retaining any fault."
msgstr "关闭算法准入并保留故障。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"Task context. Caller separately withdraws/join all hardware and users before"
" reclaiming this state or its references."
msgstr "任务上下文。调用者在回收此状态或其引用之前，单独撤回并会合全部硬件及使用者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized owner."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的串行所有者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; no provider or hardware operation."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不操作 provider 或硬件。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Clear a fault only while algorithm admission is disabled."
msgstr "仅在算法准入已禁用时清除故障。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"Task context. Product first proves hardware recovery and joined users; "
"clearing this code never enables output."
msgstr "任务上下文。产品先证明硬件恢复及使用者会合；清除本错误码从不使能输出。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[inout] Initialized DISABLED same-executor owner."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 DISABLED 同执行者所有者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; remains DISABLED on success."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；成功后仍为 DISABLED。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Stage a complete newer parameter revision for a boundary."
msgstr "暂存完整且更新的参数版本，等待周期边界切换。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"Task context. Gains preserve the last calculated output where representable."
" Active trajectory geometry cannot be changed. No persistence, hidden lock "
"or partial publication."
msgstr "任务上下文。在可表示时，增益调整保留最后计算的输出。不能修改活跃轨迹的几何条件。不持久化，不隐藏锁，也不逐部分发布。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[inout] Initialized same-executor owner, one pending slot."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的同执行者所有者，提供一个待应用槽。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Independent complete legal parameter snapshot."
msgstr "[in] 独立、完整且合法的参数快照。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE or BUSY; rejection preserves state."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID/STATE 或 BUSY；拒绝时保留状态。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Track an additional downstream current-reference limitation."
msgstr "跟踪额外的下游电流参考限制。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"Task context. Back-calculation uses the declared tracking rate; track before"
" staging a new revision. No hardware adoption or physical current is "
"inferred."
msgstr "任务上下文。回算使用声明的跟踪速率；先完成跟踪，再暂存新参数版本。不据此推断硬件已采用或真实电流。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[inout] Owner after a successful step, before the next step."
msgstr "[inout] 成功 step 后、下次 step 前的所有者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Exact most recent decision, once only."
msgstr "[in] 精确匹配的最新决策，仅处理一次。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] Downstream accepted reference, not a measured winding current."
msgstr "[in] 下游接纳的参考，不是实测绕组电流。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "[in] The same positive finite cycle interval."
msgstr "[in] 同一周期的正有限时间间隔。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE, BUSY or EXHAUSTED; error preserves state. BUSY "
"retains the cycle when parameters are pending."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID/STATE、BUSY 或 EXHAUSTED；错误时保留状态。参数待应用时返回 BUSY，不消费该周期。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Immutable microsecond domain and sampling budgets."
msgstr "不可变的微秒时间域与采样预算。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Complete independent parameter revision in SI mechanical units."
msgstr "使用 SI 机械单位的完整独立参数版本。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"velocity_kp is A/(rad/s), velocity_ki is A/rad, position_kp is 1/s. Gains, "
"tracking rate, integral limit and tolerances are finite and nonnegative. "
"Current/velocity limits and acceleration are strictly positive; the finite "
"position minimum is below its maximum. settling_us is a continuous observed "
"dwell, not a physical guarantee. stop_feedforward_a is an explicit "
"STOPPING/HOLDING bias, bounded by current_limit_a. It does not reuse a "
"previous acceleration bias or establish mechanical support. Downstream "
"limits still apply."
msgstr ""
"velocity_kp 的单位为 A/(rad/s)，velocity_ki 为 A/rad，position_kp 为 "
"1/s。增益、跟踪速率、积分限制和容差均有限且非负。电流／速度限制及加速度严格为正；有限位置范围的下限小于上限。settling_us "
"表示连续观察的停留时间，不是物理保证。stop_feedforward_a 是显式 STOPPING／HOLDING 偏置，受 "
"current_limit_a 约束。它不复用先前的加速偏置，也不证明机械支撑。下游限制仍然适用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Copied command, with the original local receipt and finite authority."
msgstr "复制的命令，保留原始本地接收时间及有期限的授权。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"CURRENT selects current_a; VELOCITY selects velocity_rad_s and adds "
"current_a as feed-forward; POSITION selects position_rad with a rest-to-rest"
" trajectory, and current_a as feed-forward. POSITION requires "
"velocity_rad_s=0. All fields must be finite. Position and velocity use the "
"same mechanical side as feedback. Current is the downstream motor reference "
"in A, never scaled by the gear ratio. No authentication is provided."
msgstr ""
"CURRENT 选择 current_a；VELOCITY 选择 velocity_rad_s，并把 current_a 加作前馈；POSITION "
"选择 position_rad 的静止到静止轨迹，并把 current_a 加作前馈。POSITION 要求 "
"velocity_rad_s=0。全部字段必须有限。位置和速度与反馈使用同一机械侧。电流是下游电机参考，单位 A，绝不按齿比缩放。不提供身份认证。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Complete caller-qualified mechanical feedback."
msgstr "完整且由调用者确认有效的机械反馈。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"velocity_rad_s describes [interval_start, sampled_at]. sampled_at identifies"
" the selected observation event, not an invented aperture. The caller proves"
" timestamp origin, calibration and mechanical side. Publication sequence is "
"consecutive for this axis consumer."
msgstr ""
"velocity_rad_s 描述 [interval_start, sampled_at] 区间。sampled_at "
"标识所选观察事件，不伪造采样孔径。调用者证明时间戳来源、标定和机械侧。对此轴消费者，发布序号必须连续。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Final downstream current-reference admission limits, in amperes."
msgstr "最终下游电流参考准入范围，单位 A。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Copied software decision; no hardware or physical adoption promise."
msgstr "复制的软件决策，不承诺硬件或物理采用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"adopted_at is when this executor adopted command_sequence. The downstream "
"provider separately reports staged/applied output facts. requested_current_a"
" precedes total current limiting. Trajectory completion and measured "
"position settling are independent facts."
msgstr ""
"adopted_at 是本执行者采用 command_sequence 的时刻。下游 provider "
"单独报告暂存／采用输出的事实。requested_current_a 位于总电流限制之前。轨迹完成与测得位置已稳定是独立事实。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid "Caller-owned single-executor state, independent for every axis."
msgstr "调用者拥有、每轴独立的单执行者状态。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:75
msgid ""
"Fields are not controls. Serialize every call with the same executor; cross-"
"context code transfers complete copies through an external bounded queue or "
"guard. No allocation, task, I/O or implicit clock."
msgstr ""
"字段不作为控制入口。所有调用由同一执行者串行进行；跨上下文代码通过外部有界队列或 guard 交接完整副本。不分配内存、不创建任务、不执行 "
"I/O，也不隐式读取时钟。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:79
msgid "Fast references and continuous feedback"
msgstr "快环参考与连续反馈"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:81
msgid ""
"One Task publishes complete finite references; one fast executor adopts at "
"most one record per step. A full reference queue rejects without overwriting"
" or refreshing the original receipt. The Drive parameter revision identifies"
" its stopped Motor profile, independently of an Axis parameter revision. An "
"inhibit word bypasses reference congestion, but hardware protection and "
"withdrawal remain the provider's responsibility."
msgstr ""
"一个 Task 发布完整有限参考，一个快环执行者每步最多采用一条。参考队列满时拒绝，不覆盖，也不刷新原始 receipt。Drive 参数 "
"revision 标识其停机 Motor profile，与 Axis 参数 revision 分别管理。独立 inhibit "
"字绕过参考拥堵；硬件保护与退出仍由 provider 负责。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:88
msgid ""
"Feedback decimation retains real measurement intervals and consecutive fast "
"coverage. Its queue latches overflow or a coverage gap; consuming old "
"records does not clear that fault. Droppable telemetry requires a separate "
"object. `accepted_iq_a` is an adopted reference associated with a "
"generation, not a measured current. Match that generation to its original "
"Axis decision before tracking a downstream limit; delayed feedback cannot "
"track a newer decision."
msgstr ""
"反馈分频保留真实测量区间和连续快环覆盖。队列锁存溢出或覆盖断裂；消费旧记录不能清除故障。可丢遥测使用独立对象。`accepted_iq_a` 是关联 "
"generation 的已采用参考，不是实测电流。下游限幅 tracking 前先匹配该 generation 的原 Axis "
"决策；延迟反馈不能回算到更新的决策。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:95
msgid ""
"The optional common-bus calculation applies separate finite motoring and "
"regeneration budgets. It does not assume credit from opposing axes or "
"provide power protection. The product supplies qualified power requests, "
"applies the resulting limits and completes the mechanical stopping policy."
msgstr ""
"可选共母线计算分别应用有限消费与回生预算。它不假定反向功率轴可以抵消，也不提供功率保护。产品提供合格功率请求、实施所得限幅，并完成机械停止策略。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Explicit current references and continuous control feedback."
msgstr "显式电流参考与连续控制反馈。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Author  Nexus Team"
msgstr "作者  Nexus Team"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Initialize empty caller-provided reference storage without hardware."
msgstr "初始化调用者提供的空参考存储，不操作硬件。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Serialized Task before publication. Storage is never allocated."
msgstr "发布前在串行 Task 中调用。从不分配存储。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[out] Joined, disjoint storage for this SPSC identity."
msgstr "[out] 已会合、互不重叠的本 SPSC 身份存储。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Stable aligned array for exactly capacity records."
msgstr "[inout] 恰好容纳 capacity 条记录的稳定对齐数组。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Nonzero power of two below 2^31."
msgstr "[in] 小于 2^31 的非零二次幂。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Nonzero Core domain for every reference."
msgstr "[in] 所有参考使用的非零 Core domain。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Nonzero epoch, immutable until all executors join."
msgstr "[in] 非零 epoch，在所有执行者会合前保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; rejection preserves queue and slots."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；拒绝保持队列与槽位不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Publish a whole finite reference without changing its receipt."
msgstr "发布完整有限参考，不改变其 receipt。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"Task only. Publication is admission, never IRQ adoption. Full storage "
"rejects; generations never wrap. No pointer is retained."
msgstr "仅 Task。发布是准入，不是 IRQ 采用。存储满时拒绝；generation 不回绕。不保留指针。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Initialized queue; only its Task producer calls this."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化队列；仅其 Task 生产者调用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Separate complete same-identity newer generation."
msgstr "[in] 独立、完整、相同身份且 generation 更新的记录。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, INVALID or STATE; rejection publishes nothing."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝不发布内容。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Latch the first independent inhibit without waiting for queue space."
msgstr "不等待队列空间，锁存首个独立 inhibit。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ atomic publication. The next fast step rejects; hardware protection"
" and provider withdrawal remain separately required."
msgstr "Task/IRQ 原子发布。下一次快环 step 拒绝；硬件保护与 provider 退出仍需分别完成。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Stable initialized identity shared with the fast owner."
msgstr "[inout] 与快环 owner 共享的稳定已初始化身份。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Non-success result to retain until joined reinitialization."
msgstr "[in] 保留到会合后重新初始化的非成功结果。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; no hardware operation is performed."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID/STATE；不执行硬件操作。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Initialize one stopped fast controller and its immutable revision."
msgstr "初始化一个已停止的快环控制器及不可变 revision。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Task before the hardware session borrows drive. No actuation occurs."
msgstr "硬件会话借用 drive 前在 Task 调用。不产生激励。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[out] Fresh or joined independent caller storage."
msgstr "[out] 新建或已会合的调用者独立存储。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Complete same-domain numerical profile, copied on success."
msgstr "[in] 同一 domain 的完整数值 profile；成功时复制。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Stable initialized Task/IRQ exchange."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定、已初始化的 Task/IRQ 交接对象。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Nonzero revision required by every reference."
msgstr "[in] 每条参考必须匹配的非零 revision。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; rejection preserves drive."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝保持 drive 不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Adopt at most one reference and compute one voltage decision."
msgstr "每步最多采用一条参考并计算一个电压决策。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"Bounded IRQ/Task math. An empty queue reuses only unexpired authority. Stop,"
" expiry, stale revision or bad measurement closes admission. Final "
"modulation and hardware commit remain external and explicit."
msgstr ""
"有界 IRQ/Task 数学。队列空时只能复用未过期授权。停止、过期、旧 revision 或无效测量关闭准入。最终调制与硬件提交保持外部显式责任。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Same sole fast executor, never accessed by Task live."
msgstr "[inout] 同一唯一快环执行者；Task 不在运行期间访问。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Qualified physical sample with exact cycle identity."
msgstr "[in] 具有精确周期身份的合格物理测量。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[out] Independent result, unchanged on every failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立结果，任何失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY before a first reference, or exact latched fault."
msgstr "SUCCESS、首条参考前的 EMPTY，或精确锁存故障。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Track one final quantized plan through the current controller."
msgstr "通过电流控制器 tracking 一份最终量化计划。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"No hardware receipt. Commit failure must latch/withdraw externally; never "
"reuse advanced algorithm history after a failed commit."
msgstr "不表示硬件回执。提交失败必须由外部锁存故障并退出；提交失败后不得继续复用已经推进的算法历史。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Same fast owner after a successful step."
msgstr "[inout] 成功 step 后的同一快环 owner。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Exact most recent cycle, not tracked previously."
msgstr "[in] 尚未 tracking 的最近一次精确周期。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Final planned dq volts in the output-angle frame."
msgstr "[in] 输出角坐标系中的最终计划 dq 电压，单位 V。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS or exact current-controller error."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确电流控制器错误。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Initialize a fixed fast-to-outer feedback decimator."
msgstr "初始化固定快环到外环反馈分频器。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Task before publication; no implicit clock, queue or sampling."
msgstr "发布前在 Task 调用；没有隐式时钟、队列或采样。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[out] Joined caller storage for one fast executor."
msgstr "[out] 供一个快环执行者使用、旧使用者已完成会合的调用者存储。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Nonzero domain of the input observations."
msgstr "[in] 输入观察的非零 domain。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Nonzero immutable epoch."
msgstr "[in] 非零且不可变的 epoch。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Positive number of fast intervals per publication."
msgstr "[in] 每次发布包含的快环间隔数，为正数。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Positive maximum between fast observations."
msgstr "[in] 快环观察之间允许的最大间隔，为正数。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; rejection preserves sampler."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；拒绝保持 sampler 不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Accumulate consecutive observations and produce one real interval."
msgstr "累积连续观察，产生一个真实区间。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"IRQ/Task. Missing cycles, backward time and excessive gaps fault; "
"observations are never renumbered to hide lost coverage."
msgstr "IRQ/Task。丢周期、时间倒退和间隔过大产生故障；不通过重新编号隐藏覆盖丢失。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Same single fast executor."
msgstr "[inout] 同一唯一快环执行者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Qualified same-domain current-cycle observation."
msgstr "[in] 同一 domain 中当前周期的合格观察。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Qualified bounded position at sample_time_us."
msgstr "[in] sample_time_us 时刻的合格有界位置。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Same-cycle reference adoption receipt."
msgstr "[in] 同一周期的参考采用回执。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[out] Separate record, unchanged while BUSY or on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立记录；BUSY 或失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS at publication, BUSY while accumulating, or latched error."
msgstr "发布时 SUCCESS，累积时 BUSY，或锁存错误。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Initialize an empty continuous-feedback SPSC with external storage."
msgstr "用外部存储初始化空连续反馈 SPSC。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Task before publisher starts; IRQ publishes and Task takes copies."
msgstr "发布者启动前在 Task 调用；IRQ 发布，Task 取得副本。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[out] Joined independent queue metadata."
msgstr "[out] 已会合的独立队列元数据。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Stable aligned array of capacity records."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定对齐、容纳 capacity 条记录的数组。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Nonzero feedback domain."
msgstr "[in] 非零反馈 domain。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; rejection preserves all storage."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；拒绝保持全部存储不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Publish one whole consecutive control record, never droppable data."
msgstr "发布一条完整连续控制记录，不作为可丢数据。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"Full storage latches lost coverage independently of consumer progress. A "
"telemetry channel must be a different object with its own contract."
msgstr "存储满时独立于消费者进度锁存覆盖丢失。遥测必须使用另一个具有独立合同的对象。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Same single IRQ/fast producer."
msgstr "[inout] 同一唯一 IRQ／快环生产者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Complete disjoint same-identity observation."
msgstr "[in] 完整、互不重叠且相同身份的观察。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or exact latched STATE/OVERFLOW fault."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或精确锁存的 STATE/OVERFLOW 故障。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Copy one control record and return its slot to the fast producer."
msgstr "复制一条控制记录，并把槽位归还快环生产者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"Task only. A latched coverage fault cannot be repaired by draining old "
"records or inventing a new sequence; stop/join before reset."
msgstr "仅 Task。排空旧记录或编造新 sequence 不能修复已锁存的覆盖故障；复位前先停止并会合。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[inout] Same single Task consumer."
msgstr "[inout] 同一唯一 Task 消费者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[out] Separate output, unchanged on EMPTY or failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；EMPTY 或失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY or exact latched feedback fault."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY 或精确锁存的反馈故障。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Compute conservative per-axis power scales for one common bus."
msgstr "为同一母线计算各轴保守功率比例。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"Task only. Positive/negative demands use separate totals; no assumed credit "
"for opposing motors. Apply reference limits and track Axis downstream "
"acceptance explicitly. This is not hardware protection."
msgstr "仅 Task。正负需求分别求和；不假定反向功率电机可以抵消。显式实施参考限制并 tracking Axis 下游采用。这不是硬件保护。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Qualified finite nonnegative consumption/regeneration."
msgstr "[in] 合格、有限、非负的消费／回生预算。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Count complete signed per-axis watt requests."
msgstr "[in] count 条完整有符号各轴功率请求，单位 W。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Actual positive axis count, no maximum array is allocated."
msgstr "[in] 实际轴数量，必须大于零；不分配最大轴数组。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[in] Finite current time in the budget's qualified local domain."
msgstr "[in] 预算所确认本地域中的有限当前时间。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "[out] Disjoint count results in [0,1], unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 互不重叠的 count 项 [0,1] 结果；失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, TIMEOUT or EXHAUSTED; no retained references."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、TIMEOUT 或 EXHAUSTED；不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Complete Task-to-IRQ current reference, copied without borrowing."
msgstr "Task 到 IRQ 的完整电流参考，复制而不借用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"received_at is the original local receipt, never refreshed by a queue. "
"generation and parameters_revision are nonzero. The latter identifies the "
"stopped Motor profile, not Axis's separately adopted revision. A finite "
"current expiry must follow receipt; it remains independent from session "
"life."
msgstr ""
"received_at 是原始本地 receipt，不因排队刷新。generation 和 parameters_revision 非零。后者标识停机 "
"Motor profile，与 Axis 独立采用的 revision 不同。有限电流期限必须晚于 receipt，且与会话寿命独立。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Caller-owned SPSC reference storage and independent inhibit word."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 SPSC 参考存储与独立 inhibit 字。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"One Task publishes, one fast executor consumes. Only atomic helpers access "
"indices/inhibited concurrently. Other fields belong to their indicated "
"executor. Capacity is a power of two; full rejects without overwriting. Join"
" both executors before reinitializing any storage."
msgstr ""
"一个 Task 发布，一个快环执行者消费。仅原子 helper 并发访问索引和 "
"inhibited；其他字段归各自执行者。容量为二次幂，满时拒绝而不覆盖。重新初始化任何存储前先会合两个执行者。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Fast-executor adoption receipt, never a hardware completion."
msgstr "快环执行者的采用回执，不是硬件完成。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "One IRQ-owned algorithm instance; Task accesses only the queues."
msgstr "一个 IRQ 拥有的算法实例；Task 只访问队列。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"No task, I/O, heap or hidden clock. The reference queue remains stable "
"through hardware withdrawal and executor join. A parameter revision belongs "
"to this stopped initialization, not mutable live fields."
msgstr "没有任务、I/O、堆或隐藏时钟。参考队列在硬件退出和执行者会合期间保持稳定。参数 revision 属于本次停机初始化，不是可变运行字段。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Continuous outer-loop record, separate from droppable telemetry."
msgstr "连续外环记录，与可丢遥测分开。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"fast_first_cycle and fast_last_cycle include the shared interval endpoints. "
"Adjacent records share one endpoint. accepted_iq_a belongs to "
"reference_generation, not measured winding current. Match that generation's "
"Axis output before downstream tracking; never track a newer Axis decision "
"from this delayed receipt. command_sequence proves that command reached the "
"fast owner by this record, not its earliest adoption time across reference "
"generations. Mechanical units use the motor shaft unless the caller supplies"
" a qualified side mapping."
msgstr ""
"fast_first_cycle 和 fast_last_cycle 包含共同区间端点，相邻记录共享一个端点。accepted_iq_a 属于 "
"reference_generation，不是实测绕组电流。下游 tracking 前匹配该 generation 的 Axis "
"输出；不得用此延迟回执回算更新的 Axis 决策。command_sequence 证明该命令截至本记录的观察时刻已经到达快环 owner，不证明跨参考"
" generation 的最早采用时刻。机械单位使用电机轴侧，除非调用者提供合格侧别换算。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "IRQ-producer/Task-consumer SPSC; any overflow latches lost coverage."
msgstr "IRQ 生产、Task 消费的 SPSC；任何溢出锁存覆盖丢失。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"No automatic drop or renumbering. Once faulted, drain/reinitialize only "
"after both executors and hardware publishers have joined."
msgstr "不自动丢弃或重新编号。产生故障后，只有两个执行者与硬件发布者会合后才能排空／重新初始化。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Fixed decimator retaining actual interval and fast-cycle coverage."
msgstr "保留实际区间和快环覆盖的固定分频器。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"One fast executor owns it. Positions are caller-qualified bounded motor-"
"shaft radians; keep multi-turn integer counts upstream. It never treats Task"
" scheduling time as a measurement interval."
msgstr "由一个快环执行者拥有。位置是调用者确认的有界电机轴弧度；上游保留多圈整数计数。不把 Task 调度时间当作测量区间。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid "Finite external common-bus power budget, not a protection circuit."
msgstr "有限外部共母线功率预算，不是保护电路。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:100
msgid ""
"Positive requested power consumes the bus; negative regenerates. Budgets are"
" nonnegative watts and are not netted against each other. The caller "
"qualifies their source, domain and actual braking hardware."
msgstr "正请求功率消费母线，负功率回生。预算为非负 W，二者不相抵。调用者确认来源、domain 和实际制动硬件。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:104
msgid "Current provenance and reconstruction"
msgstr "电流来源与重构"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:106
msgid ""
"Current conversion matches the selected calibration identity and revision, "
"rejects saturated codes and bounds aperture skew. Three independent phase "
"measurements can use their sum as a consistency check; reconstructing a "
"third phase from two measurements cannot establish that independent "
"evidence. DC-link reconstruction requires two distinct observable active-"
"vector phases from the same accepted switching plan. These checks neither "
"prove zero current nor commission or persist calibration."
msgstr ""
"电流换算匹配选定标定身份和 "
"revision，拒绝饱和码并限制孔径偏差。三个独立相电流测量可用其和检查一致性；从两相重构第三相不能建立这种独立证据。母线重构要求来自同一已接纳开关计划、可观察不同相位的两个有效矢量。检查不证明零电流，也不投入运行或持久化标定。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:114
msgid ""
"Explicit timing uses actual aperture positions; bounded timing retains a "
"qualified group reference and positive skew bound without reading fabricated"
" per-phase apertures. Scheduled provider trigger coordinates remain "
"scheduled facts. A two-trigger DC capture spans both observations and the "
"last conversion, independently of any separately qualified DC-bus voltage "
"source."
msgstr ""
"显式时序使用真实孔径位置；有界时序保留合格的组参考与正偏差上界，不读取虚构的逐相孔径。provider 的计划触发坐标始终是计划事实。两触发 DC "
"采集的跨度覆盖两次观察及末次转换，与另外建立资格的母线电压来源分别管理。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Explicit calibrated current observations and reconstruction."
msgstr "显式标定电流观察与重构。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Logical phase bits; unrelated to ADC rank or switching-vector bits."
msgstr "逻辑相位位，与 ADC rank 或开关矢量位无关。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Distinguish actual aperture positions from a qualified group bound."
msgstr "区分真实孔径位置与合格的组偏差上界。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Validate an immutable sensor-chain calibration without side effects."
msgstr "无副作用地校验不可变传感链标定。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Bounded pure C11, valid from a serialized Task or IRQ."
msgstr "有界纯 C11，可在串行 Task 或 IRQ 中调用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "[in] Stable caller-qualified complete coefficients."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、由调用者确认的完整系数。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; no references retained."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Convert two or three phase observations and reconstruct one if needed."
msgstr "换算两相或三相观察，并在需要时重构一相。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid ""
"No allocation, hardware, OS or implicit time. Three independently measured "
"phases use maximum_sum_a. Two measured phases reconstruct the third without "
"treating their zero sum as a sensor diagnostic."
msgstr "无分配、硬件、OS 或隐式时间。三个独立实测相使用 maximum_sum_a。两个实测相重构第三相，不把其零和当作传感器诊断。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "[in] Stable immutable matching calibration."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、不可变且匹配的标定。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "[in] Complete same-cycle logical phase observations."
msgstr "[in] 同一周期的完整逻辑相位观察。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "[out] Separate output, unchanged on every failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出，任何失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, OVERFLOW or IO."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、OVERFLOW 或 IO。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Convert two active-vector DC-link samples into phase currents."
msgstr "把两个有效矢量母线采样换算为相电流。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid ""
"Caller proves the accepted PWM plan and current-slew error. Opposite vectors"
" observing only the same phase cannot reconstruct three phases."
msgstr "调用者证明已接纳 PWM 计划及电流变化引起的采样误差。仅观察同一相的相反矢量不能重构三相。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "[in] Matching immutable DC-link calibration in slot zero."
msgstr "[in] 槽零中的匹配不可变母线标定。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "[in] Two time-ordered independent active-vector observations."
msgstr "[in] 按时间排序、可独立观测有效矢量的两个采样。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "[out] Separate output, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Immutable calibration for one explicitly identified sensor chain."
msgstr "明确身份传感链的不可变标定。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid ""
"identity and revision are nonzero matching facts, not authentication. "
"maximum_code is at most 2^24-1, preserving integer-to-f32 precision. Codes "
"at either rail are saturation. Gains are positive A/code; direction is "
"exactly +1 or -1. An all-zero coefficient triplet marks an absent sensor; at"
" least one is present and every measured slot must be present. Phase capture"
" uses A/B/C coefficients; bus capture uses coefficient zero. Actual aperture"
" ticks, when provided, do not wrap within one cycle. maximum_skew_ticks "
"bounds the accepted approximation; the caller proves that its current-slew "
"error is acceptable. Calibration does not prove zero current, commission "
"hardware or persist results."
msgstr ""
"identity 与 revision 是非零匹配事实，不是身份认证。maximum_code 最大为 2^24-1，以保持整数转 f32 "
"的精度。任一轨值均视为饱和。增益为正的 A/code；direction 必须恰为 +1 或 "
"-1。全零系数三元组表示缺席传感器；至少一个传感器存在，每个实际测量槽都必须存在。相电流采集使用 A/B/C 系数；母线电流采集使用槽 0 "
"的系数。提供真实孔径 tick 时，同一周期内不得回绕。maximum_skew_ticks "
"限定所接受的近似；调用者证明电流变化引起的采样误差可接受。标定不证明零电流，不完成硬件投入运行，也不持久化结果。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Two or three logical phase codes, stable only during the call."
msgstr "两路或三路逻辑相位码，仅在调用期间稳定。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid ""
"Only measured_mask entries are read. Identity/revision must match the "
"selected calibration. Caller validates the source cycle/plan/epoch; these "
"pure calculations do not invent that qualification. EXPLICIT reads actual "
"aperture_tick entries; nonzero skew_bound_ticks must cover their span and is"
" retained. BOUNDED never reads aperture_tick; it requires a positive "
"qualified skew_bound_ticks and uses the stated group reference_tick. A "
"scheduled group reference is not an aperture."
msgstr ""
"只读取 measured_mask 标记的条目。身份与 revision 必须匹配选定标定。调用者验证来源的周期、计划和 "
"epoch；纯计算不会生成这些资格。EXPLICIT 读取真实 aperture_tick 条目；非零 skew_bound_ticks "
"必须覆盖其跨度，并原样保留。BOUNDED 从不读取 aperture_tick；它要求正的合格 skew_bound_ticks，并使用声明的组 "
"reference_tick。计划组参考不是采样孔径。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Two DC-link measurements in independently observable active vectors."
msgstr "在可独立观察的有效矢量内取得的两个母线测量。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid ""
"switching_vector uses binary upper-switch A/B/C as bits 2/1/0. Values zero "
"and seven are unobservable zero vectors. ADC conversion, current polarity "
"and actual switching-state provenance are external facts. Both samples must "
"belong to the same accepted cycle plan. EXPLICIT requires ordered actual "
"apertures. BOUNDED retains a positive group skew bound and reference, "
"without reading aperture_tick entries."
msgstr ""
"switching_vector 用二进制位 2/1/0 表示 A/B/C 上桥臂开关。零与七为不可观测的零矢量。ADC "
"转换、电流极性和真实开关状态来源属于外部事实。两次采样必须属于同一个已接受周期计划。EXPLICIT 要求有序的真实孔径。BOUNDED "
"保留正的组偏差上界与参考，不读取 aperture_tick 条目。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid "Reconstructed physical currents with retained observation provenance."
msgstr "保留观察来源的重构物理电流。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:120
msgid ""
"EXPLICIT reference_tick is the earliest actual aperture; BOUNDED uses the "
"caller's group reference, never an invented measured aperture. skew_ticks "
"retains the declared bound where supplied. Nonzero skew is a bounded "
"approximation, not simultaneous sampling. A reconstructed phase is never "
"independent sensor-consistency evidence."
msgstr ""
"EXPLICIT 的 reference_tick 是最早的真实孔径；BOUNDED "
"使用调用者的组参考，不虚构实测孔径。提供声明上界时，skew_ticks "
"保留该上界。非零偏差是有界近似，不是同时采样。重构相位从不作为独立的传感器一致性证据。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:124
msgid "Joint pulse and capture planning"
msgstr "联合脉冲与采集规划"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:126
msgid ""
"The modulation result contains full-carrier pulse widths, pulse starts, "
"selected capture windows and the final ideal quantized alpha/beta voltage. "
"Analog recovery, sample-and-hold, ADC occupation and CPU submission budgets "
"have separate meanings. A missing observable window returns an error without"
" publishing a partial plan."
msgstr ""
"调制结果包含完整载波脉宽、脉冲起点、所选采集窗口及最终理想量化 alpha/beta 电压。模拟恢复、采样保持、ADC 占用和 CPU "
"提交预算各有含义。没有可观测窗口时返回错误，不发布部分计划。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:132
msgid ""
"The selected provider also supplies a capture slot. Trigger, result "
"occupation and rearm must remain inside it; a mathematically observable "
"half-carrier is not usable when the hardware profile opens only the other "
"half."
msgstr ""
"选定 provider 还提供采集槽。触发、结果占用和 rearm 必须留在槽内；硬件 profile "
"只开放另一半载波时，数学上可观测的半载波也不能使用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:136
msgid ""
"The pure calculation supports selected edge/center alignment and shunt "
"topologies. A provider must explicitly map the whole result or reject it. In"
" particular, pulse starts and a single-shunt phase shift cannot be discarded"
" by a duty-only mapper. A software plan does not qualify a corresponding MCU"
" mode, PCB, actual aperture, voltage or WCET."
msgstr ""
"纯计算支持所选边沿／中心对齐及分流拓扑。provider 必须显式完整映射结果或拒绝。尤其是，只有 duty 的 mapper "
"不能丢弃脉冲起点或单分流相移。软件计划不授予相应 MCU 模式、PCB、实际孔径、电压或 WCET 资格。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:142
msgid ""
"The selected F4 DC-link mapper uses unshifted edge-aligned pulses. Its "
"initial plan must contain two independent active-vector observations; "
"neutral equal duties do not qualify. DC descriptors reside in the complete "
"declared session context and are copied after validation, never retained "
"from callback stack storage. A degenerate zero-voltage request without an "
"observable window returns `UNSUPPORTED`; unsupported fixed shifts are not "
"silently mapped or replaced by unrequested excitation."
msgstr ""
"选定 F4 DC-link mapper 使用无相移的边沿对齐脉冲。首计划必须包含两个独立有效矢量观察；中性等 duty 不具备采样资格。DC "
"descriptor 位于完整声明的会话 context 内，验证后复制，不能保留 callback 栈存储。没有可观测窗口的零电压退化请求返回 "
"`UNSUPPORTED`；不支持的固定相移不能被静默映射或替换为未经请求的激励。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Coherent integer-carrier PWM and current-sampling planning."
msgstr "一致的整数载波 PWM 与电流采样规划。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Physically distinct current-observation requirements."
msgstr "物理上不同的电流观察要求。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Carrier shape; full period ticks never means a vendor ARR value."
msgstr "载波形状；完整周期 tick 从不等同于厂商 ARR 值。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Validate one selected static carrier/observation profile."
msgstr "校验一套选定的静态载波／观察 profile。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Pure bounded Task/IRQ math; call at cold admission as well."
msgstr "纯有界 Task/IRQ 数学；冷态准入时也应调用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[in] Caller-owned stable timing and topology facts."
msgstr "[in] 调用者拥有的稳定时序与拓扑事实。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; no effects or retained references."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；无效果，也不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Jointly plan quantized output and observable current capture."
msgstr "联合规划量化输出与可观测电流采集。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid ""
"No vendor, OS, allocation or implicit clock. The caller associates the "
"result with its cycle/epoch and tracks voltage once after all planning. A "
"provider must map the entire plan or reject; never silently clamp duty or "
"retain old sample routing. Optional shifts preserve average pulse widths but"
" require a separately reviewed hardware mode."
msgstr ""
"无厂商、OS、分配或隐式时钟。调用者把结果关联到其 cycle/epoch，并在全部规划完成后 tracking 电压一次。provider "
"必须完整映射计划或拒绝；不得静默裁剪 duty 或保留旧采样路线。可选相移保留平均脉宽，但需要独立审核的硬件模式。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[in] Stable selected profile with qualified timing budgets."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且时序预算已确认的选定 profile。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite amplitude-invariant alpha/beta volts."
msgstr "[in] 有限幅值不变 alpha/beta 电压，单位 V。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[in] Positive finite selected DC-link observation."
msgstr "[in] 正且有限的选定母线电压观察。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[out] Separate complete result, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立完整结果；失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, EXHAUSTED or UNSUPPORTED for no valid window."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、EXHAUSTED，或没有有效窗口时的 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Plan only a two/three-phase shunt profile without linking bus logic."
msgstr "只规划双／三相分流 profile，不链接母线分流逻辑。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Direct bounded Task/IRQ entry; no dispatch to a bus-shunt planner."
msgstr "直接有界 Task/IRQ 入口，不派发到母线分流规划器。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[in] Stable THREE_SHUNT or TWO_SHUNT profile."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的 THREE_SHUNT 或 TWO_SHUNT profile。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite stationary alpha/beta volts."
msgstr "[in] 有限静止坐标 alpha/beta 电压，单位 V。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[in] Positive finite DC-link observation."
msgstr "[in] 正且有限的母线电压观测。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[out] Separate complete plan, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立完整计划；失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Same results as plan; SINGLE_SHUNT is INVALID."
msgstr "结果与 plan 相同；SINGLE_SHUNT 为 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Plan only a two-observation DC-link shunt profile."
msgstr "只规划具有两个观察的母线分流 profile。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Direct bounded Task/IRQ entry; selected shifts require mapper support."
msgstr "直接有界 Task/IRQ 入口；实际选中的相移需要 mapper 支持。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "[in] Stable SINGLE_SHUNT profile."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的 SINGLE_SHUNT profile。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Same results as plan; phase-shunt profiles are INVALID."
msgstr "结果与 plan 相同；相位分流 profile 为 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Immutable selected topology and conservative integer timing budgets."
msgstr "选定拓扑和保守整数时序预算的不可变配置。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid ""
"period_ticks spans one complete unfolded carrier, at most 2^24 ticks. duty "
"limits are full-period high-pulse widths. Centered widths and limits are "
"even. sensor_mask uses logical A/B/C bits 0/1/2. Phase topologies select two"
" or three samples_per_trigger; SINGLE selects one DC-link value at each of "
"two triggers. deadtime+settling bounds switching recovery; aperture bounds "
"the whole selected S/H envelope; conversion bounds trigger-to-result "
"occupancy, including aperture. irq+compute must fit before "
"commit_before_ticks. rearm_ticks covers the selected route-switch work after"
" the first single-shunt result. capture_begin/end reserve an ADC slot in "
"unfolded carrier ticks; end zero means the full period. Trigger, conversion,"
" IRQ extraction and rearm all fit in that slot. The provider supplies its "
"supported half-cycle/shared-resource range, never an application guess of "
"ARR. A nonzero single_shunt_shift_ticks authorizes one fixed phase-shift "
"candidate, only for a mapper that can preserve each pulse width. Budgets are"
" caller-qualified declarations, never measured WCET."
msgstr ""
"period_ticks 跨越一个完整展开载波，至多 2^24 tick。duty "
"限制表示整周期高脉冲宽度，中心对齐宽度和限值均为偶数。sensor_mask 用逻辑 A/B/C 位 0/1/2。相位拓扑每次触发选择两个或三个 "
"samples_per_trigger；SINGLE 在两次触发分别取得一个母线值。deadtime+settling 限制开关恢复，aperture "
"覆盖所选完整采样保持包络，conversion 覆盖包括孔径的触发到结果占用。irq+compute 必须在 commit_before_ticks "
"前完成。rearm_ticks 覆盖首个单分流结果之后的所选路线切换。capture_begin/end 在展开载波 tick 中预留 ADC "
"槽；end 为零表示完整周期。触发、转换、IRQ 抽取和 rearm 都留在此槽。provider 提供可支持的半周期／共享资源范围，应用不猜测 "
"ARR。非零 single_shunt_shift_ticks 授权一种固定相移候选，仅适用于能够保留各脉宽的 "
"mapper。预算是调用者确认的声明，从不表示实测 WCET。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "One valid capture window, with its actual logical switching state."
msgstr "一个有效采集窗口及其实际逻辑开关状态。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid ""
"The aperture starts at tick. window_begin/end bound stable sampling, "
"excluding recovery at its beginning; end is exclusive for switching. "
"phase_mask uses A/B/C bits 0/1/2; switching_vector uses upper-switch A/B/C "
"bits 2/1/0. These coordinates belong to the accompanying plan."
msgstr ""
"孔径从 tick 开始。window_begin/end 限定稳定采样，排除起点恢复时间；end 是开关区间的排他边界。phase_mask 用 "
"A/B/C 位 0/1/2；switching_vector 用上侧 A/B/C 开关位 2/1/0。这些坐标属于随附计划。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid "Complete logical pulse/capture plan, never a hardware receipt."
msgstr "完整逻辑脉冲／采集计划，不是硬件回执。"

#: ../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/control.md:150
msgid ""
"Each leg is high for duty_ticks from start_ticks, wrapping at the full "
"period. start_ticks must not be ignored by a mapper. voltage is the ideal "
"final quantized average alpha/beta voltage, excluding unmeasured "
"deadtime/device drops. At most two events are intrinsic to the selected "
"shunt modes, not a maximum-axis or arbitrary-hardware union."
msgstr ""
"每相从 start_ticks 开始保持 duty_ticks 宽度的高电平，在完整周期处回绕。mapper 不得忽略 "
"start_ticks。voltage 是最终量化理想平均 alpha/beta "
"电压，不包含未测量的死区／器件压降。至多两个事件来自所选分流模式本身，不是最大轴数或任意硬件 union。"
